# 7.4.2 Floor 2: The Tumbler Halls (22×17)\n1410:#### 7.4.3 Floor 3: The Gloam Deeps (24×18)\n1515:#### 7.4.4 Floor 4: The Eye's Vault (13×14)\n1572:### 7.5 The Rat Run (race floor, 14×12; hub ghost race and solo time trial)\n1606:### 7.6 Bestiary\n1637:### 7.7 Items\n1726:### 7.8 Spells\n1751:### 7.9 The party, the NPCs and their scripts\n1818:## 8. Dev Mode (from the pause menu; hidden in hub sessions)\n1840:## 9. Attract mode\n1872:## 10. Multiplayer\n1874:### 10.1 AI Hub session (`AIHub.active`): the Rat Run ghost race, 1 to 4 players\n1905:### 10.2 On its own\n1914:## 11. About and Credits, and the final report\n1959:## 12. Build order and milestones\n1976:## 13. Risks and how to de-risk them\n1996:## 14. Testing\n1998:### 14.1 The one command\n2006:### 14.2 The Node harness (as in `game/test.mjs` and `kits/test.mjs`)\n2032:### 14.3 Suites and what they check\n2056:### 14.4 The scripted full playthrough\n2076:### 14.5 Browser checks\n2095:### 14.6 Looking (only what scripts can't judge)\n2124:## 15. Definition of done (TASK.md coverage)\n2144 PLAN.md","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016uEu7ruDi6QNMGqeoFsYjC","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
