{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghBLnY7qxLQgqehtiDMP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FHhScHMK1bHaE8P34CBpWX","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-185330__x53986f/work/EyeOfTheBoltHolder-EyeOfTheBeholder1991-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-185330; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/19-data-about.js'; s=open(p).read()\ni=s.index(\"  testing: [\"); j=s.index(\"  engineQ:\")\ns=s[:i]+\"\"\"  testing: [\n    'About 30. Lint found 5 decorations not on walls; the rules suites found Slumber being undone by its own noise, a babble rule that never clicked and a secret counted twice; the walkthrough bot found a mis-placed lever puzzle step, a door retry need, a too-strict Tumbler Lock rule, the Stair to the Light failing once the dead boss was cleared away, and four balance spikes; the browser and AI Hub runs found a draw crash after leaving the attract mode, idle and skip timers that ran on game time, WebGPU errors in the hub iframes and progress reports paced on game time; screenshots found about eight layout problems.',\n    'About 8: the Stair to the Light not starting the ending (the game could not be finished), the draw crash after the attract mode, Slumber never working, the four balance spikes that wiped every bot run (Snick, the Gauntlet Seers, the Barracks Wardens, the boss), and the hub session sending no progress reports (a failed hub check).',\n    'The scripted full playthrough: the walkthrough bot plays all four floors and both of Veil\\\\'s branches by the real rules, so it found the unfinishable ending, the puzzle and wiring mistakes and every balance wall in minutes.',\n    'The per-screen text-fit layout check: it passed from the start and found nothing the screenshots did not.'\n  ],\n\"\"\"+s[j:]\ns=s.replace(\"'A voice bus with its own volume and a bus() accessor for the babble synth; a { pan } option on sfx through a StereoPannerNode; the Button symbols setting limited to PlayStation (default) and Xbox. All are listed in PATCHES.md.',\",\"'Four small patches to the 2D engine, listed in PATCHES.md: a voice bus with its own volume and an audio.bus() accessor for the babble synth; a { pan } option on sfx through a StereoPannerNode for sounds by bearing; the Button symbols setting limited to PlayStation (default) and Xbox; and a beard option on E.Humanoid, because dwarves need beards. The 3D engine was not changed.',\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs && node -e \"const j=JSON.parse(require('fs').readFileSync('../exit-interview.json','utf8')); console.log(Object.keys(j), Object.keys(j.sourceInformation).length, j.testingFeedback.length, j.engineFeedback.length, j.promptFeedback.length, Object.keys(j.aiHub))\"","description":"Update testing feedback, rebuild, verify exit interview JSON"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":866,"cache_read_input_tokens":731960,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":866},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5572b217-8052-4a87-b3f3-49ea658fe605","uuid":"29b78e1f-1588-4683-a755-79431d86d7a1","timestamp":"2026-11-04T03:29:29.955Z","request_id":"req_011CghBLn563QqAJNGc8gZZN","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01FHhScHMK1bHaE8P34CBpWX":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-185330__x53986f/work/EyeOfTheBoltHolder-EyeOfTheBeholder1991-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-185330; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/19-data-about.js'; s=open(p).read()\ni=s.index(\"  testing: [\"); j=s.index(\"  engineQ:\")\ns=s[:i]+\"\"\"  testing: [\n    'About 30. Lint found 5 decorations not on walls; the rules suites found Slumber being undone by its own noise, a babble rule that never clicked and a secret counted twice; the walkthrough bot found a mis-placed lever puzzle step, a door retry need, a too-strict Tumbler Lock rule, the Stair to the Light failing once the dead boss was cleared away, and four balance spikes; the browser and AI Hub runs found a draw crash after leaving the attract mode, idle and skip timers that ran on game time, WebGPU errors in the hub iframes and progress reports paced on game time; screenshots found about eight layout problems.',\n    'About 8: the Stair to the Light not starting the ending (the game could not be finished), the draw crash after the attract mode, Slumber never working, the four balance spikes that wiped every bot run (Snick, the Gauntlet Seers, the Barracks Wardens, the boss), and the hub session sending no progress reports (a failed hub check).',\n    'The scripted full playthrough: the walkthrough bot plays all four floors and both of Veil\\\\'s branches by the real rules, so it found the unfinishable ending, the puzzle and wiring mistakes and every balance wall in minutes.',\n    'The per-screen text-fit layout check: it passed from the start and found nothing the screenshots did not.'\n  ],\n\"\"\"+s[j:]\ns=s.replace(\"'A voice bus with its own volume and a bus() accessor for the babble synth; a { pan } option on sfx through a StereoPannerNode; the Button symbols setting limited to PlayStation (default) and Xbox. All are listed in PATCHES.md.',\",\"'Four small patches to the 2D engine, listed in PATCHES.md: a voice bus with its own volume and an audio.bus() accessor for the babble synth; a { pan } option on sfx through a StereoPannerNode for sounds by bearing; the Button symbols setting limited to PlayStation (default) and Xbox; and a beard option on E.Humanoid, because dwarves need beards. The 3D engine was not changed.',\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs && node -e \"const j=JSON.parse(require('fs').readFileSync('../exit-interview.json','utf8')); console.log(Object.keys(j), Object.keys(j.sourceInformation).length, j.testingFeedback.length, j.engineFeedback.length, j.promptFeedback.length, Object.keys(j.aiHub))\"","description":"Update testing feedback, rebuild, verify exit interview JSON"}}}
