racks, the floor 2 Workshop and the boss; the browser and AI Hub runs found a draw crash after leaving the attract mode, timers on game time instead of the wall clock, WebGPU errors in the hub iframes and hub progress paced on game time; screenshots and filmstrips found about ten look problems.',\n    'About 10: the unfinishable ending, the boss blocking its own relocked lock, the blocked boss cell, the attract-exit crash, Slumber never working, the balance spikes that wiped every run, and the hub session sending no progress reports.',\n    'The scripted full playthrough with its multi-seed balance sweep: the bot plays all four floors and both of Veil\\\\'s branches by the real rules, and once it played well (formation swaps, memorizing new slots, ammunition checks) every remaining failure it found was a real game bug or balance wall. It now wins all 32 seeds tried.',\n    'The per-screen text-fit layout check: it passed from the start and found nothing the screenshots did not.'\n  ],\n\"\"\"+s[j:]\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nrm -f /tmp/eotb_seeds.mjs; node tools/build.mjs && timeout 1200 node tests/run.mjs && node -e \"JSON.parse(require('fs').readFileSync('../exit-interview.json','utf8')); console.log('json ok')\"; grep -rniE \"\\bTODO\\b|FIXME|placeholder\" src | wc -l","description":"Update feedback, rebuild, run all tests, check JSON","timeout":1250000}}}
