{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The bundled HTML, exit-interview.json (parsed, all fields present) and the four required sections are all in the transcript, and the last full run passed with no TODO hits. But the condition requires every TASK.md feature to be implemented with no stubs, and the transcript does not show that. The assistant's last message concedes that cutscene and creature models are described as simple shapes and that the 'untuned' balance seeds were run after tuning in the same session. Also, the TASK.md items for Xbox glyphs, touch-only behaviour and the 1920x1080 filmstrip review were checked only partly, and the assistant chose not to address the feedback on these points."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5572b217-8052-4a87-b3f3-49ea658fe605","uuid":"667cb448-bdb8-4b40-b987-79ebd3fbe1cf","timestamp":"2026-11-04T04:20:47.362Z","isSynthetic":true}
